{"id":"e68521c447f8d753","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code.md","title":"The Book’s Wrapped Diagonal Function","display":"df-smullyan-diagonal-code — The Book’s Wrapped Diagonal Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code"],"display":"df-smullyan-diagonal-code — The Book’s Wrapped Diagonal Function","source":"第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-diagonal-code — The Book’s Wrapped Diagonal Function"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_E\">\\(r_E\\)</span> 是上游二元 wrapper 码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(d_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为下文定义的全函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\nd_E(e)\\coloneqq r_E(e,e)=g_E(W_E(E_e,e)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\nd_E(e)\\coloneqq r_E(e,e)=g_E(W_E(E_e,e)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 取整个规范表达式码域为定义域；即使输入不是公式也有确定输出。合法一元公式的输入给内部自引用闭句的码，其他输入可以给无意义表达式的码。这和旧库“识别公式后作无捕获替换、非法输入给零”的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_G\">\\(d_G\\)</span> 并非同一个数函数。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r_E","display":false},{"tex":"d_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}code}\\vdash\nd_E(e)\\coloneqq r_E(e,e)=g_E(W_E(E_e,e)).","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"d_G","display":false}],"bytes":1165,"backlinks":[{"id":"e095d63f890051fd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]] → [[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]记载原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的具体操作。连接运算按左结合解释，并保留合法串拼接的条件。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]]"}],"outgoing":["6deaff22ee062525"]}